4
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:14,660
But TMJ is actually the name of the joint,
the temporomandibular joint.

5
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,880
And there are several different things that
can cause pain in this area.

6
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,800
Here are five common causes we look for.

7
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,760
Number one, clenching or grinding.

8
